      "widgets_values": [
        "## LaMa fills only the person\n\nSAM marks the person. GROW PERSON MASK adds a margin so the edge goes too. LAMA FILL reconstructs that area and leaves every pixel outside the mask untouched. If a rim of the person remains, raise grow on GROW PERSON MASK.\n\nNeeds the ComfyUI Inpaint Nodes pack and big-lama.pt in models/inpaint."
      ]
    }
